  "title": "Procurement Policy Note 03/19: The Public Procurement (Electronic Invoices etc.) Regulations",
  "canonical_url": "https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/procurement-policy-note-0319-the-public-procurement-electronic-invoices-etc-regulations",
  "description": "This note explains that Public Procurement (Electronic Invoices etc.) Regulations 2019 are now made and describes actions required by contracting authorities.",
